  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/IMG_9200.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6666669845581px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">La noche de este jueves se ha celebrado en Man&aacute; Bar, en la calle 8 de Marzo de Onda, una cena de maridaje (24 fotos), preparada por el chef Rub&eacute;n Le&oacute;n y su ayudante Chema, con vinos TRUS, representados por Ciro Garc&iacute;a, de Palacios Vinoteca.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/SoparMaridatgeManaDijous25.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 680px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6666669845581px; line-height: 21.3333339691162px;\">Ha comenzado con un blanco tempranillo Nivei y ha terminado con un tinto crianza 2011 magnum.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparmaridatgemanavitrus/img_9191.jpg\" alt=\"img_9191\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparmaridatgemanavitrus/img_9192.jpg\" alt=\"img_9192\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparmaridatgemanavitrus/img_9193.jpg\" alt=\"img_9193\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparmaridatgemanavitrus/img_9194.jpg\" alt=\"img_9194\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparmaridatgemanavitrus/img_9196.jpg\" alt=\"img_9196\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/soparmaridatgemanavitrus/img_9197.jpg\" alt=\"img_9197\" style=\"max-width:100%;height